# The buildthis Action writes the built site name here for its reply step to
# read; it must never be committed to main. See notes/80-buildthis-bot.md.
BUILD_RESULT

# Optional: the build agent's own short line about what it built (or its answer
# to an "explain <site>" ask), prepended to the success reply. Same mechanism as
# BUILD_RESULT — written at build time, read by the reply step, never committed.
BUILD_NOTE
